### 创建用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### 获取用户 (替换 :id 为实际用户ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/1

### 获取不存在的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/99999

### 无效的用户ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/invalid

### Panic 测试端点
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/panic

